    <li><a href={sourceLink("rag-2021-arxiv-v4-full-text")}>Lewis et al. · Full paper and appendices</a><p>Section 2.1 supplies the two passage-mixture equations written above. Sections 2.5 and 4.5 explain decoding, the fixed candidate set and the limits of the update example.</p></li>
